      en: ["Goldsborough was a primary hub for cocoa production in Tobago during the 1800s.", "The Goldsborough River is noted as one of the island's most reliable water sources.", "The village is located approximately 15 kilometers east of Scarborough.", "The area sits along the main Windward Road arterial route.", "The historic estate once occupied a significant portion of the southeastern valley.", "Archaeological evidence suggests pre-Columbian settlements existed in the area."],
